Feeling very grateful today for the opportunity to spend the weekend in New York City for the first WFDF face-to-face board meeting in 4 years!

Along with getting to spend 20 hours discussing everything we do, including strategy, events, and our disciplines, it was awesome getting to see familiar faces and meet a few people in person for the first time!

There's a lot of work to do, but there's a renewed energy and hope from the board, and I'm excited for what's to come!

