This is officially the first and last time I ever work out with my hair down… idk how some of y’all do it 😭 NOT WITH THIS MANE ☝🏼 anyway, let’s get serious. I have a fire quad and glute workout for y’all to kick off your Monday. So get ur BUTT UP and let’s get moving!! 

1️⃣back squat 5x5
2️⃣leg extension - one warmup set at 15 reps and then 4 sets of 10, last two sets dropset to failure (ask me if you’re confused here) 
3️⃣hack squat 4x10 
4️⃣SL DB glute bridges 4x10 - superset with 10 walking lunges 
5️⃣step ups 4x10

BOOKMARK THIS!! New challenges on my app drop next Monday so download your free trial today to get a head start! 

