HAPPY SUNDAY ☀️🌈 it feels dang good to be back on a normal routine!!! Sundays are personally my prep days. Prep my meals for the week, prep my workouts for the week, and make sure I know what my work week looks like. If you fail to plan you plan to fail (brownie points if u know where that’s from) 

Here’s a full shoulder workout to get you inspired and MOVIN today. 

Try my app for free (in bio) for a whole months full of structured workouts! 

1️⃣ machine shoulder press 4x10
SUPERSET 2 and 3
2️⃣ standing Arnold press 4x10
3️⃣ front raises 4x10
4️⃣ lateral raises 4x10 full rom into 10 half rom 
5️⃣ cable rd pull 4x10
6️⃣ incline 3 way raise 4x10 

