Fellas. Trust me on this. If there is one day you need to show out for when it comes to gifting, it’s Mother’s Day. Do NOT let your kids pick out the same candle she got last year to give to your wife. Find out what she has been eyeing for MONTHS and GET THAT. 

We bust our ass day in and day out for our kids and family! All we want to is be appreciated on the day that’s for US🖤 {and @lululemon 😂}

