Just over a year ago, I created @_softlandings_ ☁️ ☁️☁️

I needed a place to connect to my Asian kin and talk about our nuanced experiences. So many of you resonated, and so here we are, one year later, still leaning into our softness and living beyond our ancestors’ wildest dreams…

Join us on Saturdays for the month of May in celebration of US 💛🧡🤎 at lululemon, 318 Queen St.

SAT MAY 6
10:30am - 12:00pm: Wellness Session with @deedelara of @theliminalmovement 
12pm Onwards: Social + Shop Marketplace 

SAT. MAY 13
10:30am - 12:00pm: Wellness Session with @talktherapy.with.vera and @valtee 
12pm Onwards: Social + Shop Marketplace 

SAT. MAY 20
10:30am - 12:00pm: Wellness Session with @heyjenliu of @vibeten and @valtee 
12pm Onwards: Social + Shop Marketplace 

SAT. MAY 27
