@lululemon isn't as eco-friendly as its marketing suggests. 

The brand's supply chain emissions ballooned between 2019 and 2021, but its target to reduce these emissions remains weak. lululemon scored a disappointing 'C' minus in @stand.earth's latest Fossil Free Fashion Scorecard. 

Thousands of yoga teachers and students who have signed our open letter hope lululemon can go beyond marketing by taking responsibility for its actions.

