I couldn’t wait another dang day to share my back workout with y’all from this week … this one had me DRIPPIN. 

So even though I’m not wearing any pieces in this workout… it would be an injustice to gatekeep from you that @ptulaactive bare II launch is today! Use my code for a discount too!! 

Alright, here’s the details for this workout: 

1️⃣single arm pull downs 4x10, dropset to 12 reps on the last set 
2️⃣wide grip lat pull downs, dropset every set 4x10/12 
3️⃣SA DB row 4x10
SUPERSET 4 and 5
4️⃣kayak row 4x10
5️⃣straight arm pull down 4x10
SUPERSET 6 and 7
6️⃣SA RD fly 4x10
7️⃣incline crescent row 3x10

