There’s many benefits of being out in the forest. You don’t have to be a “runner” to take advantage of that.

Hamilton has many trail segments all around us, and most folks don’t even know that.

I found this therapeutic a few years ago, and want to make sure I can get as many people outside to enjoy it too.  These trails change 4 times a season, and deliver a different experience for each one.

We belong in nature. We deserve to be out here. We need to be know we have this option.

Let’s go @steeltownathleticclub ! Continue what we’re doing and stay true to the mission. #youbelonghere 

