CHEST N TRIS❤️‍🔥 but with a little twist! I wanted to make this workout a little bit more muscular endurance based rather than strength based, so I swapped normal sets out for 2 circuits instead. Here are the details: 

1️⃣bench press 5x5
For the circuits: set a timer for 12 minutes and perform as many rounds as possible: 
CIRCUIT 1:
1️⃣seated SA cable tricep extension 10 reps 
2️⃣plate squeeze 10 reps 
3️⃣push ups 10 reps 
CIRCUIT 2
4️⃣underhand chest press 10 reps 
5️⃣bench dips 10 reps 
6️⃣flys 10 reps 

