I took 5 days off from the gym and didn’t lose any progress. 

This is the most I’ve taken off since my senior year spring break trip in 2021. For those who love the gym or have worked so hard to feel comfortable in your body, things like going on vacation can be scary when it means taking off time from the gym. 

So I wanted to post this picture of after and before my five days off to show you that it’s okay!!! Enjoy life’s opportunities. Go on that vacation. The gym will be there when you get back. 

