5:01 vs 9-5 🤓

I get asked so often how I’m able to balance work and a healthy lifestyle. The short answer: planing ahead and prioritizing. Yep, that’s the big secret. While it may seem impossible, there is always enough time in the day if you make time. Sometimes that means getting up early, or grinding after work even when you just want to relax. 

If you plan your days out in advance, it’s possible to be both a Killa at work and a beast in the gym. Hey, if I can do it so can you.

