It’s an awkward question when someone asks, “so what is it that you do?” 😂

Mostly because I don’t how to answer in a short enough response that a casual conversation requires. Partly because I’ve never actually sat down and listed all the ways that I make money each month, until today. 👇🏻

• UGC Content {brands pay me to create vids that THEY USE on their social media, ads, websites, etc.} 

• Brand Collaborations {brands pay me to create videos that I POST on my own social media featuring their products} 

• Outsourced Social Media Services {People/Companies pay me to create posts/videos of them/their products and post them on THEIR social media} 

• Affiliate Links {Amazon Associates, Lululemon Creator, Like to Know It- I share the product, people buy it, and I get a commission amount per each sale from the company} 

• Etsy Shop {Selling my Presets and Photo Editing how-to} 

• Facebook and Instagram REELS Bonus {FB and IG pay me PER VIEWS on my videos} 

… it sounds like a lot, but I’ve got I down to a science at this point. 

I earned $4,567 on JUST UGC Content + Brand Collaborations last month, and I’ve gotten my workload down to less than 2 hrs per day, while watching my crazy kids 🤯 

I’ve been thinking real hard about offering online courses each month on each of these different revenue streams. 🤔 I would definitely start with UGC content, because it requires NO FOLLOWING to do and you can make a TON of money doing it 🙌

What do ya’ll think? Would you have interest if I started doing these courses? 👇🏻 

{The price would be pretty cheap- likely under $30 for the full 1 hr session.}

{adding because I know ya’ll will ask, tank is from @essersexpressions and it is the CUTEST. Use code TAYLOR10 to save $$ at checkout} 

