Slow and controlled wins the race 🤞🏼here’s the thing with tricep exercises, when you’re trying to target your triceps you want to make sure your elbows are tucked closer to your body. This will ensure tension is on the triceps instead of the chest/rotator cuff. Just a lil bit of knowledge for ya. Now why don’t we jump into this workout? 

1️⃣bench press 5x5
SUPERSET 2 and 3 
2️⃣incline machine chest press 4x10
3️⃣db overhead extension 4x10
4️⃣SA machine chest press 4x10
SUPERSET 5 and 6
5️⃣low cable fly 4x10
6️⃣dips 4x8 (mod with bench dips)
SUPERSET 7 and 8
7️⃣SA underhand tricep extension 4x10
8️⃣cable rope extension 4x10

