Started this thing 9 years ago, and was immediately thrown into the fire after a month. Having started on an Open, this will be my 10th. My love for this thing, and how it’s changed my life, cannot be overstated. 

I went from getting piss drunk or n the regular to being the healthiest I’ve ever been in my life, and not just physically. This thing has taught me how to manage my emotions, celebrate little victories, and not get lost in comparison, but fully immersed in the joy of the process.

I’ve learned to take better care of myself, and as a result, those around me. It’s given me purpose, and put me in position to help others. I cannot be more grateful.

This will be my last year in this age division, and I’m going out swinging, and next year I’m coming in fighting. 

I love this fuckin’ thing.

(📸: CrossFit Mean Streets Circa 2014, Downtown Los Angeles) 

