I get asked almost every week what my biggest source of motivation is. The simple answer? The girl in the second picture. That girl felt horrible in her skin and was stuck in what seemed like a never ending depression. 

Staying on top of my physical health helps the state of my mental health, and seeing where I’m at physically/mentally now motivates me to keep going so I’m never that girl in the second picture again. 

So yeah, I guess I am my biggest motivator. You should be yours too. 

