my photo goes up on @lululemon ‘s wall in a week I am filled with so much joy, gratitude, and excitement to be a part of such an amazing brand, community, and family. 

#thesweatlife is about finding joy in movement and making meaningful connections with others who care about the physical and mental health, of themselves and the world. 

I want to thank @sodiumsoul for being such a great friend, amazing human, and an inspiration to me and so many others. Thank you from the depths of my heart for introducing me to the team ❣️ 

