Your health is not a competition. 

Social media can bring both good and bad. It’s easy to feel the pressures of trying to be “as good” as the people we see online. So I wanted to take a minute to remind you today that your health is not a competition. 

Your body doesn’t stand as a comparison. 

You shouldn’t copy and paste from the people you see online. Use it as inspiration, sure, but the only person you should be competing with is your past self. It doesn’t matter who has the biggest muscles, the leanest bodies, etc. it just matters how you feel in your body. 

