It has been a great year at the group run. I’ve had so much fun hosting on Saturday mornings. Serving up coffee, chatting about running and watching relationships grow in the running community truly fills my cup. Today we had 1st timers, Boston marathoners, 50 staters and even SHORTS! 

Looking back at the year I can honestly say I’ve got a lot that I’m proud of, but three things stand out. Working with @bryanboysforhope coordinating first Thursday volunteering for @st_francishouse and the @the437project completely transformed me. Running does amazing things and getting to be a VERY small part in these programs stands out in 2022. 

I’m looking forward to 2023 and cannot wait to see what sort of running year awaits! 
