TGIF baby and I’m sending you Friday energy in the form of this quad and glute workout, you’re welcome 🥹🥹a lot of my movements stay the same each week but in different variations and that’s because THESE MOVEMENTS WORK. I’m living proof of it! Here’s the workout: 

1️⃣ back squat 5x5 
2️⃣ myo rep hip thrusts 3 sets (myo reps means that you perform one full set of 10 reps, and take a five second break and then five more reps until failure) 
3️⃣b stance pendulum squat 4x10 (modify with hack squat) 
4️⃣ single leg press 4x10 each into 10 calf raises 
SUPERSET 5 and 6
5️⃣ adduction, machine 4x10
6️⃣ band kickbacks 4x10

Really excited for you guys to try this one, especially the myo reps!! 

