I’d be lying if I said it didn’t take me years to feel comfortable and confident in my body. That’s me, that’s my own relationship with myself and it’s journey. But I will say that I didn’t reach that point by seeking quick fixes and fast results. 

The problem with that is that quick and fast fixes aren’t sustainable and we wind up in this cycle of one step forward and two step backs. I got to where I am with myself through sustainable changes in my lifestyle and years of time. And I hope that if you’re not already there, you get there too one day. And that I can help you on your way 🖤

