HOW BAD DO YOU WANT IT? 

I have been pretty quiet on social media the last couple weeks while I’ve been doing some things behind the scenes and accomplishing a dream of mine. 

How bad do you want it has been a common theme in my life and has become a mantra for me as of lately. 

While chasing dreams and accomplishing goals this mantra often gets repeated in my head. Everything in life comes down to how bad do you want it. Most things in life aren’t meant to be easy. Life is unfair, it’s hard. It will knock you down, it will break you at times. The key here though is to keep moving forward. To keep going. 

I grew up being told I’ll never be good enough. That I wasn’t smart enough. That I would be nothing and go no where. I had made it my life’s mission to prove that person and anyone who doubted me wrong. Through sports, through fitness and through accomplishments I have strived to be the best at everything, every time. 

I have accomplished a lot. I have seen a lot, and I have been through a lot. Lately though, my accomplishments have really set in and made me take a second to appreciate who I have become. 

How bad do you want it? Because I want it more than air most times. I’m willing to do anything to achieve my goals. I’m willing to go as far as it takes. I remind myself of this every time I achieve another goal. Every time I accomplish a dream. I will take in the moment. Then I will keep going. This is only the beginning. 

The best is yet to come. 

